---
// Hero emocional con overlay + dos CTAs diferenciados (§6.2).
---

<section class="hero" aria-label="Bienvenida">
  <img
    class="hero-img"
    src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1450778869180-41d0601e046e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80"
    alt="Voluntaria abraza a un perro rescatado"
    width="1600"
    height="900"
    loading="eager"
  />
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-contenido contenedor">
    <div class="hero-caja">
      <span class="hero-badge">
        <span class="hero-punto"></span>
        46 años protegiendo la vida animal en Costa Rica
      </span>
      <h1 class="hero-h1">Cada animal merece una vida digna.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Rescatamos, sanamos y protegemos a miles de animales cada año. Con castración preventiva,
        educación y comunidad construimos un país donde ninguno quede atrás.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="/donar" class="btn-donar hero-cta-primario">
          <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7.5-4.6-10-9.2C.3 8.5 1.7 5 5 5c2 0 3.2 1.2 4 2.3C9.8 6.2 11 5 13 5c3.3 0 4.7 3.5 3 6.8C19.5 16.4 12 21 12 21z"></path></svg>
          Donar ahora
        </a>
        <a href="#mision" class="hero-cta-secundario">
          Conoce nuestra misión
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    background: #1a1816;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center 30%;
  }
  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      100deg,
      rgba(20, 18, 16, 0.92) 0%,
      rgba(20, 18, 16, 0.72) 42%,
      rgba(20, 18, 16, 0.25) 100%
    );
  }
  .hero-contenido {
    position: relative;
    padding-top: 96px;
    padding-bottom: 104px;
  }
  .hero-caja {
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(212, 35, 43, 0.18);
    border: 1px solid rgba(212, 35, 43, 0.5);
    color: #ff9a9e;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .hero-punto {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ff5a60;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .hero-h1 {
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 58px;
    line-height: 1.04;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #e4ded6;
    margin: 0 0 36px;
    max-width: 540px;
  }
  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .hero-cta-primario {
    font-size: 17px;
    padding: 16px 28px;
  }
  .hero-cta-secundario {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 17px;
    padding: 16px 28px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
    transition: background 0.15s;
  }
  .hero-cta-secundario:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-h1 {
      font-size: 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
